			& \shortstack{Proposed\\\scriptsize (Momentum+Chol)}   & $282 / 207$ & 14.59 & 915,021   & 13,725,315 & \textbf{-40.6\%} & \shortstack{$5,719.5$\\\scriptsize $\pm 1,187.9$} & 8,813.8  & \textbf{1.61$\times$} & $0.0326$ \\
			\midrule
